                                                "sense_id": "f7814870-77b9-335a-9aab-7ec44d3f20e3",
                                                "text": "In Cornwall is two speches, the one is naughty Englysshe, and the other is Cornysshe speche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4368537b-198b-48cb-9b3b-dcbc8e429022",
                                                "sense_id": "f7814870-77b9-335a-9aab-7ec44d3f20e3",
                                                "text": "One basket had very good figs, even like the figs that are first ripe: and the other basket had very naughty figs, which could not be eaten, they were so bad."
